/T (U.S. Escalation in Venezuela and Cartels: Trump imposed an oil tanker blockade on Venezuela in December, disrupting Maduro's regime by targeting sanctioned vessels, which transport nearly all Venezuelan oil. This was built on an August directive, authorizing the Pentagon to use force against select LATAM drug cartels, signaling the reinforcement of the Monroe Doctrine. China responded with a white paper on its LATAM strategy, emphasizing non-interference to counter U.S. moves and protect its $500bn+ trade ties. These actions heightened geopolitical risks, potentially destabilizing governance in Venezuela, Mexico, and Colombia while testing institutional strength in countering external interventions.)
/E (U.S. Escalation in Venezuela and Cartels: Trump imposed an oil tanker blockade on Venezuela in December, disrupting Maduro's regime by targeting sanctioned vessels, which transport nearly all Venezuelan oil. This was built on an August directive, authorizing the Pentagon to use force against select LATAM drug cartels, signaling the reinforcement of the Monroe Doctrine. China responded with a white paper on its LATAM strategy, emphasizing non-interference to counter U.S. moves and protect its $500bn+ trade ties. These actions heightened geopolitical risks, potentially destabilizing governance in Venezuela, Mexico, and Colombia while testing institutional strength in countering external interventions.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3 4 5]
>>
