/T (Regional Forecast: Opportunity remains real but uneven: India offers scale and strong infrastructure growth, but U.S tariffs and FX-management remain key risks. Sri Lanka, on the other hand, offers recovery-plus-reconstruction deal flow with higher execution risk post its economic crisis in 2022. Opportunities in the Maldives remain concentrated in tourism and hospitality sectors, but feature established rivals and high sovereign risk. Looking ahead, growth will remain strong, but shocks may become more frequent, reinforcing the importance of treasury discipline, supply-chain redundancy, and flexible market-access strategies.)
